# Telegram Routing (Shared Atom)

> Applies to: ALL agents

---

## Thread Mapping

| Thread | Who Reports | What |
|--------|------------|------|
| **718** | System (auto) | Changelog, Master Doc updates, releases |
| **727** | Product-Designer, Frontend-Developer, Backend-Developer | Design & implementation progress |
| **735** | QA-Tester **ONLY** | Test results, quality gates |

---

## CRITICAL Rules

- ❌ QA-Tester **DOES NOT** report to 727
- ❌ Design/Devs **DO NOT** report to 735
- ✅ 718 chỉ cho changelog & releases (auto-send)

---

## Commands

```bash
# Thread 727 — Design/Dev report
node scripts/send-dev-report.js \
  --agent "<agent>" --feature "<feature>" \
  --status "completed|blocked|failed" \
  --message "<content>" --thread "727"

# Thread 735 — Test report
node test-pre-commit.js --telegram --thread "735"

# Thread 718 — Changelog
node scripts/send-changelog.js \
  --title "Summary" --category "feature|fix|security" \
  --changes "Change 1\nChange 2" --thread "718"
```
